<view class="setup-page"><view class="setup-head"><text class="eyebrow">PERSONAL PROFILE</text><text class="setup-title">完善个人资料</text><text class="sub">可选择微信头像和昵称，也可以从相册更换头像并修改名称。</text></view><view class="setup-card"><button class="avatar-picker" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view wx:else class="avatar-placeholder"><text>＋</text><text>选择微信头像</text></view></button><view class="avatar-actions"><button class="outline" bindtap="chooseFromAlbum">从相册选择</button><button wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" class="outline danger" bindtap="removeAvatar">移除头像</button></view><text class="field-label">姓名或昵称</text><input class="nickname-input" type="nickname" value="{{realName}}" placeholder="请选择微信昵称或手动输入" bindinput="onNameInput" maxlength="20"/><text class="field-hint">保存后，小启助手将使用这个名称称呼你。</text><button class="save-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="onSave">{{saving?'正在保存…':'保存资料'}}</button></view></view>
